Hi {{greeting_name}},

I lead corporate development at The Viral Fever (TVF) - one of India's largest independent studios, with a platform reaching tens of millions of viewers.

{{hook}}

We're looking at a small number of product companies whose technology would slot straight into how we make and distribute content, and {{company}} is one of them. I'd value 20 minutes to understand where you're headed and whether there's a fit - as a customer, a partner, or something more strategic.

Open to a call?

{{footer}}

Hi {{greeting_name}},

Following up on my note about {{company}} and The Viral Fever. If 20 minutes in the coming weeks would be useful, I would be glad to find a time that suits you.

{{footer}}
